   "response_text": "Let me analyze the metrics more carefully:\n\n**Validation Accuracy Analysis:**\n- Healthy range: 0.8538\u20130.8599 (approximately 0.8568)\n- Observed values: ranging from 0.861271 to 0.867610\n- All values are ABOVE the healthy range by ~0.007-0.009\n\nThis is a significant anomaly. The validation accuracy is consistently higher than the healthy reference range. Let me check the training logs and read the training code to understand what might be causing this:",
