     "- Reads hyperparameters from SM_HPS env var or --config flag.",
     "- Reads data from SM_CHANNEL_TRAIN env var or --data-dir flag.",
     "- Writes model artifacts to SM_MODEL_DIR env var or --output-dir flag.",
